OL,3,GWales                                  
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCold, 
OL,6,Fbright and dry on Wednesday with brief 
OL,7,Fsunny spells. A frosty Thursday        
OL,8,Fmorning, though with cloud thickening  
OL,9,Flater. Rain and strengthening winds to 
OL,10,Freturn on Friday.                      
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
